        <initializer>= false</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The file should contain: 1) The block info block that describes how to read the blocks. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>2) The metadata block that contains various information about the remarks in the file. 3) A number of remark blocks. We need to set up 1) and 2) first, so that we can emit 3) after. This flag is used to emit the first two blocks only once. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
